# What To Eat - Self-Contained Skill Package

Version: 1.0.0
Generated: 2026-07-19T15:09:20.550Z

## Deployment Package Information

This is a self-contained skill package that can be copied and used independently.

## Usage

1. Copy this entire directory to your target project
2. Copy data/example.json to data/dishes.json (or run collect commands to initialize)
3. The skills are ready to use in Claude Code or other AI tools

## Skills Included

- what-to-eat (main skill)
- what-to-eat-recommend
- what-to-eat-collect
- what-to-eat-manage
- what-to-eat-visualize

## Scripts

All runtime scripts are located in the scripts/ directory.
